          "body": "Across their last 11 games, the team scored 314 points and conceded 351, averaging 28.5 points scored and 31.9 conceded per match. Their biggest win in that window came against Canada, whom they defeated 63-10 at home in September 2025 during the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage."
