          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "France and league governing body face scrutiny over leaked World Cup workload list",
          "body": "France face heightened scrutiny ahead of the international season after a secret player workload agreement between the French federation and league governing body LNR was leaked by Midi-Olympique. The document outlines rest periods and a nine-Test limit for 33 premium players ahead of next year's tournament. The revelations have sparked debate among supporters over potential impacts on club campaigns and notable omissions from the list."
