          "kicker": "Stadium return",
          "heading": "Italy And South Africa To Clash At Turin's Allianz Stadium",
          "body": "Top-level international rugby returns to the Allianz Stadium as Juventus' home ground prepares to host Italy against reigning world champions South Africa in November. Gonzalo Quesada's side begins their November series in Turin before facing Argentina in Genoa and Fiji in Udine, following three away matches during the summer against Japan, New Zealand and Australia. Giorgio Chiellini noted the stadium continues to demonstrate its vocation for hosting major events and its role as a point of reference for the local area."
