          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Wales Women Lose Seren Lockwood To Injury Ahead Of USA Test",
          "body": "Scrum-half Seren Lockwood has been ruled out of Wales Women's second fixture against the USA at Cardiff Arms Park after failing a head injury assessment during the victory over South Africa. Lockwood's absence forces a reshuffle in the backline, with Lleucu George returning at fly-half and Keira Bevan reverting to scrum-half. Head coach Sean Lynn acknowledged the setback, stating, \"It's always sad to see an individual coming off, but the HIA is great to have on board, we're looking after her.\""
