          "heading": "Argentina men secure gold medal victory at South American Games",
          "body": "Argentina captured the gold medal at the 2026 Juegos Suramericanos rugby sevens tournament after recording a hard-fought 17-7 victory over Chile in the final at the Hipódromo in Rosario. Following a severe storm that forced tournament organisers to push the final fixtures back by a day, the hosts delivered a clinical display on home soil to cement their regional dominance. The victory also secures automatic qualification for the 2027 Pan American Games in Lima."
