          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Harry Potter And The Wallabies Wait Out Springboks Selection",
          "body": "Australia winger Harry Potter has taken a cheeky dig at South Africa head coach Rassie Erasmus after the Springboks made 13 changes to their starting XV for Sunday's clash in Perth. Asked whether knowing the opposition lineup so early offered an advantage, Potter joked, \"Well, we'll wait for the 23 to be absolutely confirmed.\" While Erasmus has a history of making late alterations on the eve of his team's matches, Potter is still expecting a formidable challenge from a visiting side featuring numerous World Cup winners."
