          "kicker": "Pacific triumph",
          "heading": "Naoto Saito leads Japan past Fiji to claim Pacific Nations title",
          "body": "The Brave Blossoms secured their first Pacific Nations Cup title since 2019 with a hard-fought 20-15 victory over holders Fiji at Prince Chichibu Memorial Stadium. Captain and player of the tournament Naoto Saito called the win a great breakthrough to create history for Japan. Mamoru Harada and Ben Gunter scored tries, while Sam Greene added vital points as Japan withstood fierce physicality to claim their fifth win against Fiji and move into the world top ten."
        },
